<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For Nanda 🌸</title>

<style>
*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
}

body{
  height:100vh;
  overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd6e7,#fff1f7,#ffd9ef);
}

.card{
  width:90%;
  max-width:500px;
  padding:35px 25px;
  text-align:center;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  border-radius:25px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(255,80,150,.2);
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  animation:appear 1.5s ease;
}

.flower{
  font-size:65px;
  animation:float 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

h1{
  margin:15px 0;
  color:#ff4f91;
}

p{
  color:#555;
  line-height:1.7;
  font-size:17px;
}

b{
  color:#ff4f91;
}

.heart{
  position:absolute;
  bottom:-50px;
  animation:up 7s linear infinite;
  opacity:.8;
  font-size:25px;
}

.h1{left:10%;animation-delay:0s}
.h2{left:30%;animation-delay:2s}
.h3{left:50%;animation-delay:4s}
.h4{left:70%;animation-delay:1s}
.h5{left:90%;animation-delay:3s}

@keyframes float{
  0%,100%{
    transform:translateY(0) rotate(-5deg);
  }
  50%{
    transform:translateY(-15px) rotate(5deg);
  }
}

@keyframes appear{
  from{
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(30px);
  }
  to{
    opacity:1;
    transform:translateY(0);
  }
}

@keyframes up{
  0%{
    transform:translateY(0) rotate(0);
    opacity:0;
  }
  20%{
    opacity:.8;
  }
  100%{
    transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
    opacity:0;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="heart h1">💕</div>
<div class="heart h2">🌸</div>
<div class="heart h3">💗</div>
<div class="heart h4">✨</div>
<div class="heart h5">💖</div>

<div class="card">

  <div class="flower">🌸</div>

  <h1>alooo, princess 🌸</h1>

  <p>
    ak bingung ihh, mau chat apa besokk, jadi ak bikin ini dehh.
    <br><br>
    kurng baguss sii soalnya cuman semalem aja, tapi semoga bisa bikin kamu

    <b>senyum sedikit</b> hari ini hehe.
    <br><br>
    Jangan lupa bahagia yaa ✨
  </p>

</div>

</body>
</html>
